msgid "Migration Guide"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus 2.12 is a relatively small release, with most development happening "
"in August and all."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"But it still comes with a lot of documentation improvements, fixes and "
"enhancements, most notably:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Upgrade to GraalVM/Mandrel 22.2"
msgstr ""

msgid "Upgrade to Kotlin 1.7"
msgstr ""

msgid "SmallRye Config SecretKeys support"
msgstr ""

msgid "Microsoft SQL Server JDBC driver update"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To migrate from 2.11, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"wiki/Migration-Guide-2.12[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "GraalVM/Mandrel 22.2"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"It was already possible to use it with Quarkus 2.11 but\n"
"GraalVM/Mandrel 22.2 is now the default version for building native "
"executables."
msgstr ""

msgid "Kotlin 1.7"
msgstr ""

msgid "Our Kotlin extensions got upgraded to Kotlin 1.7."
msgstr ""

msgid "SmallRye Config SecretKeys"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Support for https://smallrye.io/smallrye-config/Main/config/secret-keys/"
"[SmallRye Config SecretKeys] has been added."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We were using a very old version of the Microsoft SQL Server JDBC driver, "
"due to some issues when compiling to native executables.\n"
"We were finally able to upgrade to version 11.2.0.jre11 in Quarkus 2.12.0."
"Final."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/2.12.0.CR1[2.12.0.CR1] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/2.12.0.Final[2.12.0.Final] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

